                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Survey concerning sharing of domestic tasks by partners,  use of facilities, and division of responsibilities. Everyday life and daily activities / working situation / living conditions / income / support from family, friends and  neighbours / household composition / facilities to combine a job  with care for children / time-spending / dividing domestic tasks /  care for children / financial situation / family planning /  gender roles / attitudes towards women's liberation, childcare, and  work Background variables: basic characteristics/ housing situation/ household characteristics/ occupation/employment/ income/capital assets/ education/ consumption of durables</p>"
